"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-24T22:44:54-08:00","id":773664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=773448#post773448\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mankind already has flight. Can we get time travel, instead? I think we could clean up a lot of this mess with a do-over!</div> </div> </div> </div>Assisted flight. I meant like individuals flying of their own power. I'd be down with time travel though, that's my go-to answer for the &quot;if you could have one superpower&quot; question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T04:07:02-08:00","id":773807,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=773664#post773664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Assisted flight. I meant like individuals flying of their own power. I'd be down with time travel though, that's my go-to answer for the &quot;if you could have one superpower&quot; question.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm surprised people don't go with &quot;grant my own wishes&quot; and get the power of omnipotence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T08:16:45-08:00","id":773977,"title":"","content":"I'm glad for Nerak's advice on how to best report spammers: It's made me feel like my reporting is more helpful than it was before, without being as...overwhelming isn't the <i>right</i> word, but it's close.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T09:26:41-08:00","id":774052,"title":"","content":"Yeah I always wondered if it was worth reporting or if mods just saw the posts throughout their browsing.<br /> <br /> And at the risk of being a cynical buzzkill, do you really want to be responsible for giving suicide bombers the ability to fly wherever they want, or to allow fundamentalists to go back in time and make it so their beliefs remain unopposed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T10:18:56-08:00","id":774091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=773807#post773807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm surprised people don't go with &amp;quot;grant my own wishes&amp;quot; and get the power of omnipotence.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's just that kind of thing is a bit of a cop-out and against the intent of the question. You give that answer and they just roll their eyes and say &quot;ok, but like, if you could be an X-men character or something, what mutant ability would you want?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=774052#post774052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah I always wondered if it was worth reporting or if mods just saw the posts throughout their browsing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, it's a huge help. We can't browse all of the sub forums all of the time, so we'll miss things. Besides that, we see all of the reports in the same place and they link to the reported post, so it makes deleting them and banning the offenders faster.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=774052#post774052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And at the risk of being a cynical buzzkill, do you really want to be responsible for giving suicide bombers the ability to fly wherever they want, or to allow fundamentalists to go back in time and make it so their beliefs remain unopposed?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think there's a single superpower that we wouldn't find ways to abuse if all of humanity had access to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T10:40:56-08:00","id":774105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=774091#post774091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's just that kind of thing is a bit of a cop-out and against the intent of the question. You give that answer and they just roll their eyes and say &quot;ok, but like, if you could be an X-men character or something, what mutant ability would you want?&quot;<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually the &quot;one super power&quot; falls flat when you realize that any one individual power is shit without the others to compliment it. When asked that question, I would choose the power to redirect energy in my area. Lots of pretty OP things you can do with that and still fall under the one power rule.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I've started flagging spam bots once I figured out how to do it. :P<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=774052#post774052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And at the risk of being a cynical buzzkill, do you really want to be responsible for giving suicide bombers the ability to fly wherever they want, or to allow fundamentalists to go back in time and make it so their beliefs remain unopposed?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> And to those fundamentalists, I would say we go back in time with hard evidence that opposes their beliefs and end the problem before it starts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 11-25-2015, 01:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T10:43:35-08:00","id":774108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=774091#post774091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think there's a single superpower that we wouldn't find ways to abuse if all of humanity had access to it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was thinking if everyone was able to create a glass of water just by snapping their fingers there'd probably be a lot less problems. But then you'd have people chopping off peoples fingers to make sure they were dependent on others.<br /> <br /> If you're going to get a gift for the gods and force it on everyone, something less super-powery like 'more tolerance for' or 'less desire to hate, hurt or kill' other humans sounds a solid way to go.<br /> <br /> If you're just getting something for yourself go crazy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T10:45:32-08:00","id":774111,"title":"","content":"Don't be ridiculous, the Gods would never take away our hatred for each other. It's how they convince us to fight on their behalf!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T12:43:34-08:00","id":774205,"title":"","content":"Object creation. You could solve a lot of problems if you could just conjure food for the hungry, though I wonder what that would do to the economy...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T13:28:08-08:00","id":774236,"title":"","content":"But food is one exception from Gamp's Law of Magical Transfi... wait a second, wrong setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T16:57:14-08:00","id":776276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/771195-slaying-the-beast-spam-bots?p=774236#post774236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But food is one exception from Gamp's Law of Magical Transfi... wait a second, wrong setting.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I just reported like 3 or 4 different spam accounts on different forums. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> As for conjuring food, probably not much would effect the economy, humanity spends a crap load of money on frivolous pleasures. We would just have more money to do so!<br /> <br /> <br /> In fact, if anything it would greatly balance out the Supply and Demand shit we have going on right now. The only way it would go sour is if you're trying to summon currency.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13